= Snap election called

Since taking power in early October, the XXXXXX Government has faced a series of hurdles which have prevented it from exerting full control over the nation. WIP. As a means to break the deadlock, new elections have been called for February 9378, Week 3.

Both the <span style="color: var(--vp);"><strong>VPs</strong></span> and <span style="color: var(--lf);"><strong>LF</strong></span> have announced that they will not participate in the election, while the <span style="color: var(--adp);"><strong>ADP</strong></span> and <span style="color: var(--dcp);"><strong>DCP</strong></span> may leave it up to their local branches to decide. Those who do participate will likely do so under a joint <span style="color: var(--opposition);">Republican</span> list.

- @celebrate: This is an occasion to celebrate.
- @complacency: The Nazis are still a threat. We must not be too complacent.

@celebrate

This is an occasion to celebrate! Hopefully he Nazis will no longer be a threat to the Republic.

@complacency

Even in their weakened state, the Nazis are still a threat. We must not be too complacent.

